  </div>
</div>

<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow reveal">About</div>
    <h2 class="section-title reveal">A small number of clients. A large amount of writing.</h2>
    <div class="about-grid" style="margin-top:44px;">
      <div class="reveal">
