        <p>Ongoing writer for the House of Staunton and United States Chess Federation blogs, contributing more than 60 SEO-optimised articles, features and newsletter pieces to date.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="case-images">
        <div class="shot"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Who Is the Best Chess Player Ever, USCF blog post"></div>
        <div class="shot"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="What is Freestyle Chess, House of Staunton article"></div>
        <div class="shot full"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="What is Material in Chess, feature story"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="case reveal" data-category="blog">
      <div class="case-info">
        <div class="meta">Blog Writing &middot; 2023</div>
        <h3>Book An Eye Test</h3>
